Package: mobd
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Frozen <1884084+xrdavies@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/xrdavies/mobd
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgstreamer1.0-0, libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, xvfb, openbox, dbus-daemon | dbus, x11-xkb-utils, xkb-data, systemd
Recommends: fonts-dejavu-core, fonts-noto-cjk, xdg-utils, gstreamer1.0-libav
Suggests: chromium | firefox-esr | google-chrome-stable
Description: office agent daemon for the mob apps
 mobd runs Codex, Claude Code and Pi turns for the Mob desktop and mobile apps.
 On Linux every conversation gets its own virtual desktop (Xvfb, openbox)
 that the agent drives and the apps watch live; idle desktops sleep in the
 cgroup freezer.
 .
 Each user starts it with `mobd init` and `mobd start` (a systemd user
 service); nothing runs as root.
